<title>INDIA: All bids at Indian repo auction rejected-RBI.</title>
<headline>All bids at Indian repo auction rejected-RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it rejected all the bids received at its four-day repo auction of government securities.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received three bids for a total amount of 20 billion rupees and rejected all.</p>
<p>It did not give any reason.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
